flowchart TD
    classDef edge fill:#e5e7eb,stroke:#4b5563,color:#1f2937;
    classDef mcp fill:#bbf7d0,stroke:#15803d,color:#14532d;
    classDef evidence fill:#bfdbfe,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#1e3a8a;
    classDef draft fill:#fde68a,stroke:#b45309,color:#7c2d12;
    classDef human fill:#fecaca,stroke:#b91c1c,color:#7f1d1d;
    classDef seal fill:#ddd6fe,stroke:#6d28d9,color:#4c1d95;
    classDef neg fill:#fed7aa,stroke:#c2410c,color:#7c2d12;

    U["End user — ONE plain-language prompt (memory case)"]:::edge
    C["Claude session + Agentropix-SIFT MCP<br/>72 tools · LLM orchestrates, never authors a fact"]:::mcp
    S0["Step 0 · pre-flight + custody<br/>environment ready · evidence_register → SHA-256 chain of custody<br/>NOTE: no get_image_info on a raw .mem (EWF-only — returns empty)"]:::mcp
    S13["Steps 1-3 · open the case<br/>case_init → case_activate → case_status (active · indexer reachable)"]:::mcp
    TH{"Thymus read-only gate<br/>check_read allowlist · check_write REJECT<br/>no write tool exists"}:::seal
    EV[("Read-only evidence<br/>/cases/memdump/memdump.mem")]:::evidence

    PS["Step 4 · get_pslist<br/>Volatility auto-detects the kernel profile on the first windows.* plugin<br/>populated list = OS/profile confirmed"]:::mcp
    NEG["Honest negative<br/>empty list + symbol_table error = no profile resolved → stop the memory chain, report it"]:::neg
    S5["Step 5 · memory chain<br/>get_netscan (sockets / C2) · get_malfind (injected/RWX code)<br/>get_svcscan (services) · build_process_tree (PPID forest · LOLBin flags)"]:::mcp

    RF["Step 6 · record_finding<br/>findings stamped DRAFT (indexed:false) — agent cannot self-approve"]:::draft
    HG["Step 7 · HUMAN approval gate<br/>HMAC challenge-response · examiner portal · the one step no model can do"]:::human
    RG["Step 8 · report_generate<br/>+ courtroom seal (evidence SHA-256 + HMAC, tamper-evident)"]:::seal
    OUT["Results — custody hash · process/network/injection highlights<br/>DRAFT findings (IDs) · report ID · honest negatives"]:::edge

    U --> C --> S0 --> S13 --> TH
    TH -->|"ALLOW read"| EV
    TH --> PS
    EV -.->|"bytes, read-only"| PS
    PS -->|"populated pslist"| S5
    PS -.->|"empty"| NEG
    S5 --> RF --> HG
    HG -->|"examiner signs"| RG --> OUT
